{"page":68,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:141","surah":3,"ayah":141,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِيُمَحِّصَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَيَمْحَقَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"for Him to cleanse those who believe and for Him to destroy the disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِيُمَحِّصَ","en_gloss":"And so that may purify","transliteration":"waliyumaḥḥiṣa","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَمْحَقَ","en_gloss":"and destroy","transliteration":"wayamḥaqa","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"3:141"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٤١","en_gloss":"(141)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:141"}]},{"verse_key":"3:142","surah":3,"ayah":142,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ حَسِبْتُمْ أَن تَدْخُلُوا۟ ٱلْجَنَّةَ وَلَمَّا يَعْلَمِ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ جَـٰهَدُوا۟ مِنكُمْ وَيَعْلَمَ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Did you think you would enter the Garden without God first proving which of you would struggle for His cause and remain steadfast?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَسِبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"do you think","transliteration":"ḥasib'tum","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"you will enter","transliteration":"tadkhulū","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","en_gloss":"Paradise","transliteration":"l-janata","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"while has not yet","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَعْلَمِ","en_gloss":"made evident","transliteration":"yaʿlami","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَـٰهَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"strove hard","transliteration":"jāhadū","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"and made evident","transliteration":"wayaʿlama","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the steadfast","transliteration":"l-ṣābirīna","verse_key":"3:142"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٤٢","en_gloss":"(142)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:142"}]},{"verse_key":"3:143","surah":3,"ayah":143,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ كُنتُمْ تَمَنَّوْنَ ٱلْمَوْتَ مِن قَبْلِ أَن تَلْقَوْهُ فَقَدْ رَأَيْتُمُوهُ وَأَنتُمْ تَنظُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Before you encountered death, you were hoping for it. Well, now you have seen it with your own eyes.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَمَنَّوْنَ","en_gloss":"wish","transliteration":"tamannawna","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","en_gloss":"(for) death","transliteration":"l-mawta","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qabli","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَلْقَوْهُ","en_gloss":"you met it","transliteration":"talqawhu","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَأَيْتُمُوهُ","en_gloss":"you have seen it","transliteration":"ra-aytumūhu","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"while you (were)","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"looking on","transliteration":"tanẓurūna","verse_key":"3:143"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٤٣","en_gloss":"(143)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:143"}]},{"verse_key":"3:144","surah":3,"ayah":144,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا مُحَمَّدٌ إِلَّا رَسُولٌ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِهِ ٱلرُّسُلُ ۚ أَفَإِي۟ن مَّاتَ أَوْ قُتِلَ ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ عَلَىٰٓ أَعْقَـٰبِكُمْ ۚ وَمَن يَنقَلِبْ عَلَىٰ عَقِبَيْهِ فَلَن يَضُرَّ ٱللَّهَ شَيْـًٔا ۗ وَسَيَجْزِى ٱللَّهُ ٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Muhammad is only a messenger before whom many messengers have been and gone. If he died or was killed, would you revert to your old ways? If anyone did so, he would not harm God in the least. God will reward the grateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُحَمَّدٌ","en_gloss":"(is) Muhammad ","transliteration":"muḥammadun","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَسُولٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlun","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"certainly","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلَتْ","en_gloss":"passed away","transliteration":"khalat","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَبْلِهِ","en_gloss":"before him","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلُ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] (other) Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusulu","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَفَإِي۟ن","en_gloss":"So if","transliteration":"afa-in","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّاتَ","en_gloss":"he died","transliteration":"māta","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"3:144"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُتِلَ","en_gloss":"is slain","transliterati